flowchart TD
    HR[HR Manager] --> UI[React + TypeScript HR Web App]
    UI -->|HTTP JSON requests| API[Express REST API]

    API --> ROUTES[Routes and Request Validation]
    ROUTES --> SERVICES[Employee, Salary and Analytics Services]
    SERVICES --> REPO[SQLite Data Access Layer]
    REPO --> DB[(SQLite Database)]

    SEED[Deterministic Synthetic Data Seeder] --> DB

    DB --> REPO
    REPO --> SERVICES
    SERVICES --> API
    API -->|Employee details and salary history| UI
    UI --> UPCOMING[Derive upcoming status from effectiveDate later than today, no employee flag stored]
